Package: BiocKB
Title: Bioconductor Knowledge Base for AI-Assisted Analysis
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jacques Serizay", ,
        email = "jacquesserizay@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Provides a pre-built retrieval-augmented generation (RAG)
    knowledge base derived from the source code, vignettes, and metadata
    of all Bioconductor packages. The database is hosted on ExperimentHub
    and cached locally via BiocFileCache. It is designed to be used by the
    BiocAI package suite to ground LLM responses in real Bioconductor
    documentation. Includes utilities to fetch, chunk, and manage the
    knowledge base.
